# varies: the cases differ (hand, eye station or texture, fevered palate, speed of ideas), but each instance of "appears various" is the same claim, that the quality is perceived differently while the object stays unaltered.
# inmatter: "in Matter", "without the mind" and "pattern of a real being" are used together throughout as one claim about mind-independent existence.
